Package: luci-app-singbox-admin
Version: 0.0.1
Depends: luci-base, sing-box, nftables
Section: luci
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Yukiinagato
Description: LuCI web admin for sing-box on OpenWrt
 Manage sing-box directly from LuCI: a live dashboard (service state,
 per-process CPU/RAM, clash-api connection count, listening sockets and
 logs), a config.json editor with sing-box validation and timestamped
 backups/restore, a rollback-protected nftables/tproxy firewall-script
 manager (validate, apply now, apply on boot), and one-click sing-box
 binary updates from GitHub releases with architecture auto-detection.
